Description: spa: libcamera: Apply the negotiated capture frame rate
 Use the configured camera's FrameDurationLimits to validate a fixed video
 frame rate and pass it to Camera::start(). Return the live format, including
 its frame rate, when a new client negotiates with a running source.
 Use a separate configuration for negotiation. Export the buffers and
 orientation from the configured stream, not from the enumeration template.
 Use the captured timestamps for the SPA clock when rate control is unavailable.
Forwarded: no

